[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, good morning, this is Talia from Parrot Bay Travel Agency.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Is Robert Goddard there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm so sorry that I made such an early phone call,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm calling to ask a few questions about your most recent vacation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I have five minutes of your time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I see here that you visited Melbourne.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Was this your first visit to Melbourne?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/11.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I have actually been there twice before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what would you say was your favorite part about Melbourne?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I did like seeing the exotic wildlife,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are great sites to see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but I have to say I was most impressed by the amazing weather.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, the weather there is amazing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Which of the sites listed as part of our official tour did you see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and of those, which was your favorite?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/20.mp3"},{"answer":"First I saw the theatre, which was beautifully designed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It was not nearly as cool as the Town Hall though -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/22.mp3"},{"answer":"the building is a huge part of Melbourne's history.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely my favourite.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw the aquarium too, but wasn't too impressed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, people often have great reviews of Town Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I would like to ask you about your dining experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you enjoy the food there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely, I loved it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad to hear it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me a little bit about what you most enjoyed about the food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Being such an international city, I loved the variety -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I could find any type of food I wanted.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Whether I wanted seafood, burgers, or anything else, you name it and they had it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you drive to Melbourne?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/36.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I flew.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought about going by train,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but in the interest of time I decided to go by plane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And would you mind telling me whether you are under 20,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/41.mp3"},{"answer":"between the ages of 20 and 40, or older than 40?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, it would be nice if I were still under 20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/43.mp3"},{"answer":"My vacation probably would have been quite different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually though, I just turned 41 last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, happy birthday!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/46.mp3"},{"answer":"So did you treat yourself and fly first class?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Ha! No way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I would love to have a budget that high.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm more in the mid-range income level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't always though - I spent much of my life in a low-income household.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That answers my next question then, of income level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And what was the purpose of this visit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to go there on business a lot before and decided I would go there for tourism this time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And what is your occupation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I am mainly a computer programmer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/58.mp3"},{"answer":"I also write for a travel magazine on the side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/59.mp3"},{"answer":"which is why I visited Melbourne before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's not my main source of income.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, it sounds like you work a lot!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am very busy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/64.mp3"},{"answer":"which is exactly why I took a nice week-long vacation to Melbourne.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I completely agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you care to comment on your accommodation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/67.mp3"},{"answer":"My hotel was a good value.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Staying in the city can get really expensive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/69.mp3"},{"answer":"so it was nice to find such a good price for the location and quality.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad I didn't end up in some cheap motel in the middle of nowhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad you didn't either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thank you for taking part in our survey,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm glad you enjoyed your vacation!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/74.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem. Take care!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-7-part-1-2023-06-21-10-42-41/75.mp3"}]
